:: UserStylesheet [stylesheet]
.passage { background: #fef; padding: 1em; }

:: UserScript [script]
setup.fixtureToken = "sugarcube-fixture-v1";

:: Start
<<set $hasKey to false>>
You stand before a heavy oak door.
[[Search the floor|Search]]
[[Try the handle|Try Handle]]

:: Search
<<set $hasKey to true>>
A small iron key glints among the leaves.
[[Take it and try the door|Try Handle]]

:: Try Handle
<<if $hasKey>>The key turns smoothly. The door swings open.
[[Step inside|Cellar]]<<else>>The handle won't budge.
[[Search the floor|Search]]<</if>>

:: Cellar [ending]
A cool cellar greets you. ''The end.''
